    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Perfectly situated just off the Main Street, this 3-bedroom, mid-terrace two-story house (c. 82 m2), offers town-center convenience alongside quiet residential living with parking area to the front and pedestrian side access to year yard. The property combines an efficient layout with a \r\nlow-maintenance exterior, making it an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\n1.75 m x 1.75 m, tiled floor, radiator, power & phone points, carpet and stairs, alarm.\r\n\r\nSittingroom:\r\n4.68 m x 3.32 m, fireplace with electric fire, laminated flooring, window, radiator, \r\npower & T.V. points, French doors to Kitchen/Diningroom.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diningroom:\r\n4.27 m x 4.53 m, split level kitchen units with built-in oven and extractor fan, \r\nunderstairs storage, tiled floor, radiator, power points, door to yard.\r\n\r\n1st Floor:\r\n\r\nHotpress: Shelved.\r\n\r\nBathroom:\r\n3.13 m x 1.89 m, electric shower, toilet, WHB, cabinet, radiator, window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\n4.9 m x 2.52 m, built-in wardrobes, timber floor, power points, phone point, radiator, vent, \r\nwindow.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\n4 m x 2.4 m, built-in wardrobes, timber floor, power points, radiator, vent, window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\n2.3 m x 1.88 m, timber floor, radiator, power points, vent, window.\r\n\r\nOFCH.\r\nMains water & sewerage.\r\nSide pedestrian to private, low-maintenance rear yard space.\r\nDouble-glazed white uPVC windows & doors.\r\nFully fitted alarm system."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
